{"id":"n71735-1-8","stage":1,"title":"넷째 · 第四","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71735-1-8-1","ko":"많이 다쳤니? 의사가 뭐라고 그래?","zh":"伤得严重吗？医生怎么说？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"다쳤니?","meaning":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","explanation":"다치다：受伤，负伤，弄伤；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"다치다","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73400","senseId":"1","lemma":"다치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다쳤니","audio":"/audio/cd34b5da413f391cf238.mp3"}},{"text":"의사가","meaning":"医生","explanation":"의사：医生；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"의사","audio":"/audio/9b6834dbb2bfc221d4ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20256","senseId":"1","lemma":"의사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"의사가","audio":"/audio/b30394f79165cdb5b57d.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐라고","meaning":"什么（询问事物或情况）","explanation":"뭐：什么（询问事物或情况）；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라고：引用命令或名词判断；要与前后引用表达连用。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐라고","audio":"/audio/95d23f1968b7f0de1b5c.mp3"}},{"text":"그래?","meaning":"好吧，是","explanation":"그래：好吧，是","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"12851